Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}离我远一点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Stay away from me!{\r}
