Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}彼特想告诉你什么消息{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What was the big news Pete wanted to tell you?{\r}
