Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}终极格斗比赛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...Fighting Competition thingy.{\r}
