Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是什么味道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What is that taste?{\r}
